# The mod embeds the text of tools/*.sh and tools/*.ps1 verbatim to write it
# into script-output, and a byte comparison in the tests ties the embedded copy
# to the file in the repository. bash also refuses a CRLF shebang line. So these
# two must keep LF on checkout regardless of core.autocrlf.
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
